{"unit_id":"MrWeiCodes__dsh-loop-guard#feature-1","repo":"MrWeiCodes/dsh-loop-guard","commit":"343661fd9855f904315787c7acdb1e7869bbaac5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-loop-guard 的功能「跨调用停滞识别」：统计连续只推理无产出的调用，或比较相邻调用的推理材料；达到阈值后按设置警告、引导模型或取消回合。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/detector.ts:680-800","src/index.ts:404-429"]}
{"unit_id":"MrWeiCodes__dsh-loop-guard#feature-2","repo":"MrWeiCodes/dsh-loop-guard","commit":"343661fd9855f904315787c7acdb1e7869bbaac5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-loop-guard 的功能「推理流内熔断」：逐块检查 reasoning-delta，识别精确重复周期或反复短语池，在调用结束前截断无法自行结束的推理循环。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:592-600","src/detector.ts:999-1141"]}
