{"unit_id":"MrWeiCodes__dsh-loop-guard#caveat-1","repo":"MrWeiCodes/dsh-loop-guard","commit":"343661fd9855f904315787c7acdb1e7869bbaac5","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-loop-guard 使用前须知：若检测命中时仍有工具调用等非文本块未闭合，流内熔断会跳过，以免截断参数；该次调用结束后的检测仍会运行。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:471-489","src/index.ts:603-608"]}
